    },
    "A Yomi backup, a .tachibk from Mihon or Tachiyomi, or a Tachimanga .tmb. It merges into your library — nothing is replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una copia de Yomi, un .tachibk de Mihon o Tachiyomi, o un .tmb de Tachimanga. Se combina con tu biblioteca: no se reemplaza nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chosen voice reads novels in its language; others use the best installed voice. More natural voices: iPhone Settings → Accessibility → Read & Speak → Voices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una voz elegida lee las novelas en su idioma; las demás usan la mejor voz instalada. Voces más naturales: Configuración del iPhone → Accesibilidad → Leer y hablar → Voces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A list of extensions published by someone else. Each extension adds one source to Browse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
