    "Welcome to Yomi": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te damos la bienvenida a Yomi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a repository is": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué es un repositorio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a refresh finds chapters for your library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando una actualización encuentra capítulos para tu biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the iPhone is dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando el iPhone está en modo oscuro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While a reader is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras un lector está abierto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you read a novel in your library, the next chapters are saved so they open instantly and work offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras lees una novela de tu biblioteca, se guardan los capítulos siguientes para que abran al instante y funcionen sin conexión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you read a novel in your library, the next chapters are saved so they open instantly and work offline. Only on Wi-Fi (Settings → Downloads).": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras lees una novela de tu biblioteca, se guardan los capítulos siguientes para que abran al instante y funcionen sin conexión. Solo con Wi-Fi (Ajustes → Descargas)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blanco"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole words only, so “Li” doesn’t change “Like”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo palabras completas, para que “Li” no cambie “Lima”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wide": {
      "comment": "Looked up at run time",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ancho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it down — Yomi can't show it again. Forgot it? Delete and reinstall Yomi (back up your library first).": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anótalo: Yomi no puede volver a mostrarlo. ¿Lo olvidaste? Elimina y reinstala Yomi (primero haz una copia de tu biblioteca)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong passcode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Código incorrecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong passcode. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Código incorrecto. Inténtalo de nuevo en un minuto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow": {
      "comment": "Looked up at run time",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amarillo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ayer"
